{"seq":3,"slug":"continuation-writing","title":"高三英语 — 读后续写","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/gaokao-skills/continuation-writing","wordCount":2187,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高三英语-读后续写\">高三英语 — 读后续写</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>读后续写（Continuation Writing）是新高考英语的标志性题型，分值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span></span></span> 分，要求考生阅读一篇约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>350</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">350</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">350</span></span></span></span></span> 词的短文后，根据给出的两个段落开头续写两段内容，每段约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span> 词，总续写量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>250</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">250</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">250</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span> 词。这一题型全面考查考生的阅读理解能力、故事构思能力、语言表达能力和情感描写能力。读后续写的评分标准明确要求&quot;与原文融洽度高&quot;&quot;情节合理&quot;&quot;语言丰富&quot;，其中&quot;融洽度&quot;是最关键的评分维度——续写部分必须在人物性格、叙事风格和情节走向上与原文保持一致。</p>\n<p>读后续写的评分维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>权重</th>\n<th>高分标准</th>\n<th>低分表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>与原文融洽度</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>人物性格一致，情节自然衔接</td>\n<td>情节突兀，人物&quot;变脸&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情节合理性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>情节发展合乎逻辑，有转折有高潮</td>\n<td>情节平淡或不合逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言丰富度</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>词汇多样，句式灵活，描写生动</td>\n<td>词汇单一，句式单调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语法正确性</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>基本无语法错误</td>\n<td>语法错误影响理解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>篇幅与格式</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n<td>字数达标，两段分明</td>\n<td>字数不足或只写一段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-读后续写的解题流程\">一、读后续写的解题流程</h3><p><strong>第一步：精读原文</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟）</p>\n<p>精读原文时需要提取以下关键信息：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>提取要素</th>\n<th>具体内容</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人物</td>\n<td>主要人物的性格特征和关系</td>\n<td>续写中人物行为须一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情节</td>\n<td>故事发展到哪一步？冲突是什么？</td>\n<td>续写从中断处衔接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情感</td>\n<td>当前的情感基调是什么？</td>\n<td>续写的情感走向须合理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线索</td>\n<td>原文中埋下了哪些伏笔？</td>\n<td>续写应回收伏笔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风格</td>\n<td>原文的叙事风格（幽默/温馨/紧张？）</td>\n<td>续写风格须一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>第二步：分析段首句</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟）</p>\n<p>两个给定的段落开头句是续写的&quot;路标&quot;。从段首句中判断：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一段续写应该发展到什么情节？</li>\n<li>两段之间的过渡是什么？</li>\n<li>第二段如何收束故事？</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>第三步：构思情节</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟）</p>\n<p>在草稿纸上简要列出两段的情节要点（中文或英文均可）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一段：发生了什么事？人物有什么反应？</li>\n<li>第二段：问题如何解决？人物获得了什么感悟？</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>第四步：撰写续文</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟）</p>\n<p>按构思写出两段续文，每段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span> 词。</p>\n<p><strong>第五步：检查修改</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟）</p>\n<p>检查语法错误、拼写错误和逻辑连贯性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-情节构思的核心原则\">二、情节构思的核心原则</h3><p><strong>原则一：情节必须与原文段首句衔接</strong></p>\n<p>第一段的开头句已经给定，你的续写必须紧接这句话自然展开。不能跳过段首句的信息另起炉灶。</p>\n<p><strong>原则二：情节要有&quot;起伏&quot;</strong></p>\n<p>好的续写不是平铺直叙，而是有波澜：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一段可以写困难加剧、意外发生或矛盾激化</li>\n<li>第二段写转折出现、问题解决和情感升华</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>原则三：结尾应体现&quot;成长&quot;或&quot;感悟&quot;</strong></p>\n<p>高考读后续写几乎都是正能量的故事，结尾应体现主人公的成长、感悟或人际关系的改善。常见的结尾主题：勇气、友谊、坚持、感恩、理解。</p>\n<p><strong>原则四：回收原文伏笔</strong></p>\n<p>如果原文提到某个物品、人物或细节，续写中应让它再次出现并发挥作用。这是体现&quot;融洽度&quot;的关键。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-高分语言表达技巧\">三、高分语言表达技巧</h3><p>读后续写对语言的要求远高于普通作文。高分续写的语言特征是&quot;动作描写细腻、情感表达丰富、感官描写多样&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>动作描写链</strong>：用连续的动作描写替代概括叙述。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>低分表达</th>\n<th>高分改写</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>She was very happy.</td>\n<td>Her eyes lit up and a wide smile spread across her face. She jumped to her feet and threw her arms around her mother.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>He ran to the door.</td>\n<td>He sprang from his chair, dashed across the room, and flung the door open.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>She cried.</td>\n<td>Tears welled up in her eyes, streaming down her cheeks. She buried her face in her hands, her shoulders trembling.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>情感描写句型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情感</th>\n<th>表达方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>紧张</td>\n<td>Her heart was pounding. / A knot formed in her stomach. / She held her breath.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>喜悦</td>\n<td>Joy flooded through her. / Her heart sang with delight. / She could barely contain her excitement.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>悲伤</td>\n<td>A wave of sadness washed over him. / His heart sank. / He felt a lump in his throat.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惊讶</td>\n<td>His jaw dropped. / She stood frozen in disbelief. / His eyes widened in astonishment.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>感动</td>\n<td>Warmth spread through her chest. / She was deeply moved. / Tears of gratitude blurred her vision.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>环境描写作为情感烘托</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情感基调</th>\n<th>环境描写</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>温馨</td>\n<td>The golden sunlight streamed through the window. / A gentle breeze carried the scent of flowers.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>紧张</td>\n<td>Dark clouds gathered overhead. / The wind howled through the empty streets.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>希望</td>\n<td>The first rays of dawn painted the sky in shades of pink and gold.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"四-常见的故事类型与续写模式\">四、常见的故事类型与续写模式</h3><p>高考读后续写的原文通常属于以下几种类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>故事类型</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>续写方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冒险/生存</td>\n<td>户外遇险、迷路、自然灾害</td>\n<td>解决危机 → 获救 → 感悟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人际关系</td>\n<td>误解、冲突、陌生人帮助</td>\n<td>化解矛盾 → 和解/感恩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个人成长</td>\n<td>面对挑战、克服恐惧</td>\n<td>突破自我 → 收获成功/自信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>助人为乐</td>\n<td>帮助他人遇到困难</td>\n<td>坚持帮助 → 双方受益</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"五-续写中的常见错误\">五、续写中的常见错误</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误类型</th>\n<th>具体表现</th>\n<th>改正方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人物&quot;变脸&quot;</td>\n<td>原文中害羞的角色突然变得大胆</td>\n<td>保持人物性格一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情节跳跃</td>\n<td>从困境直接跳到圆满结局</td>\n<td>加入过渡和细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过度&quot;开挂&quot;</td>\n<td>不切实际的巧合解决所有问题</td>\n<td>让解决方案合理可信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言贫乏</td>\n<td>全篇只有 said, went, happy</td>\n<td>使用多样的动词和形容词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字数不达标</td>\n<td>每段不足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 词</td>\n<td>增加描写细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忽略段首句</td>\n<td>续写内容与给定段首句脱节</td>\n<td>第一句必须紧接段首句</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"六-实用句型积累\">六、实用句型积累</h3><p><strong>开启新情节</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Just then, something unexpected happened.</li>\n<li>To her surprise / relief / horror, ...</li>\n<li>Without hesitation, he decided to...</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>描写心理活动</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A thought suddenly flashed through her mind.</li>\n<li>He knew deep down that this was the right thing to do.</li>\n<li>Mixed feelings of anxiety and hope swirled inside her.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>结尾升华</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Looking back, she realized that this experience had changed her in ways she never expected.</li>\n<li>It was then that he understood the true meaning of...</li>\n<li>From that day on, she never forgot the lesson she had learned.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>选取一篇高考读后续写真题，只读原文和段首句，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟内用中文列出两段的情节要点，然后再开始英文写作。</li>\n<li>将以下低分表达改写为高分表达：①&quot;He was angry.&quot;（用动作和神态描写替代）②&quot;The weather was bad.&quot;（用具体的环境描写替代）③&quot;She felt nervous.&quot;（用身体反应描写替代）</li>\n<li>积累 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 个高级动作描写动词（替代 go, say, see, think 等基础动词），为每个动词写一个例句。</li>\n<li>完整练习：在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟内完成一篇读后续写（含阅读原文、构思和写作），然后对照评分标准自评。</li>\n<li>互评练习：与同学交换续写作品，重点评价&quot;与原文融洽度&quot;和&quot;语言丰富度&quot;两个维度。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>英语小说和短篇故事是提升叙事写作能力的最佳素材，推荐 O. Henry 的短篇小说（反转结尾的写法可直接借鉴）。</li>\n<li>《Elements of Style》（Strunk &amp; White）是英语写作的经典指南，其中关于&quot;用具体替代抽象&quot;&quot;用动词替代形容词&quot;的建议对续写极有帮助。</li>\n<li>高考评分标准的&quot;档次描述&quot;（各省考试院公布）是了解阅卷老师期望的第一手资料。</li>\n<li>影视作品的情节结构（如&quot;英雄之旅&quot;模式：困境→挑战→转折→成长）可以迁移到续写的情节构思中。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>读后续写的备考核心是&quot;融洽度优先、语言丰富度并重&quot;。精读原文时提取人物性格、情感基调、伏笔线索和叙事风格，续写时保持这些要素的一致性。情节构思遵循&quot;困难加剧→转折出现→问题解决→情感升华&quot;的经典叙事弧线。语言表达的提分关键是用动作描写链替代概括叙述、用感官描写替代抽象形容词、用环境描写烘托情感。两段续写各 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span> 词，总耗时控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟以内。每周至少练习一篇完整的读后续写并寻求反馈，是提升这一题型分数最有效的方法。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高三英语 — 读后续写","id":"高三英语-读后续写"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、读后续写的解题流程","id":"一-读后续写的解题流程"},{"level":3,"text":"二、情节构思的核心原则","id":"二-情节构思的核心原则"},{"level":3,"text":"三、高分语言表达技巧","id":"三-高分语言表达技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"四、常见的故事类型与续写模式","id":"四-常见的故事类型与续写模式"},{"level":3,"text":"五、续写中的常见错误","id":"五-续写中的常见错误"},{"level":3,"text":"六、实用句型积累","id":"六-实用句型积累"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高三英语 — 阅读理解","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/gaokao-skills/reading-comprehension"},"next":{"title":"高三英语 — 语法总复习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/language-review/grammar-review"}}